{
    "title": "Contacts: Phone Dialer",
    "description": "Improve your phone calling experience with Contacts & Phone Calls.\r\nA simple phone dialer app designed for Android users seeking efficiency and simplicity\r\nPhone dialer makes it easier to stay connected with those who matter most.\r\n\r\nContacts App Key Features:\r\nSlide to Answer: Answer phone calls faster with a simple slide.\r\n\r\nWallpapers: Personalize your phone calling screen by setting custom wallpapers.\r\n\r\nRingtones: Apply personalized ringtones to contacts.\r\n\r\nCall Button Style: Customize your call button style in our app and choose from different designs to make the calling screen more enjoyable.\r\n\r\nManage Speed Dial: Quickly access frequently dialed contacts using speed dial.\r\n\r\nQuick Response: Send quick replies to missed calls or messages.\r\n\r\nFlash on Call: Get alerted with a flashing LED light for all incoming calls or customize it to flash only for favourites or unknown numbers.\r\n\r\nMissed Call Notifications: Never miss important calls again with instant notifications and reminders.\r\n\r\nCall Logs: Access a detailed call history to review incoming, outgoing, and missed calls.\r\n\r\nCall Details: View complete details for each call, including duration, date, time, and contact information.\r\n\r\nCall Conference: Bring everyone together with easy-to-manage conference calls for work or social gatherings.\r\n\r\nDark Mode: Enjoy a comfortable viewing experience in low light conditions while saving battery.\r\n\r\nDual SIM card support: Manage contacts individually for each SIM card.\r\n\r\nMake calls smarter with Contacts & Phone Dialer.\r\nSpeed dial your favourites, never miss a call with flash alerts, and respond swiftly to missed calls. Enjoy clear phone calls and manage contacts.\r\n\r\nDownload now and upgrade your phone calling experience.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Improve your phone calling experience with Contacts &amp; Phone Calls.<br>A simple phone dialer app designed for Android users seeking efficiency and simplicity<br>Phone dialer makes it easier to stay connected with those who matter most.<br><br>Contacts App Key Features:<br>Slide to Answer: Answer phone calls faster with a simple slide.<br><br>Wallpapers: Personalize your phone calling screen by setting custom wallpapers.<br><br>Ringtones: Apply personalized ringtones to contacts.<br><br>Call Button Style: Customize your call button style in our app and choose from different designs to make the calling screen more enjoyable.<br><br>Manage Speed Dial: Quickly access frequently dialed contacts using speed dial.<br><br>Quick Response: Send quick replies to missed calls or messages.<br><br>Flash on Call: Get alerted with a flashing LED light for all incoming calls or customize it to flash only for favourites or unknown numbers.<br><br>Missed Call Notifications: Never miss important calls again with instant notifications and reminders.<br><br>Call Logs: Access a detailed call history to review incoming, outgoing, and missed calls.<br><br>Call Details: View complete details for each call, including duration, date, time, and contact information.<br><br>Call Conference: Bring everyone together with easy-to-manage conference calls for work or social gatherings.<br><br>Dark Mode: Enjoy a comfortable viewing experience in low light conditions while saving battery.<br><br>Dual SIM card support: Manage contacts individually for each SIM card.<br><br>Make calls smarter with Contacts &amp; Phone Dialer.<br>Speed dial your favourites, never miss a call with flash alerts, and respond swiftly to missed calls. Enjoy clear phone calls and manage contacts.<br><br>Download now and upgrade your phone calling experience.",
